    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "berland, October 26th.- I have sent more",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line003.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "Guits than are necessary, in case of getting",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line004.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": "a Recruit c. You must do the best you",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line005.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "can in hoding the men, as the Darracks",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line006.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "in the Fort are full. As Sergeant Wil-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line007.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "per is waiting the return of the waggons",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line008.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "from the Fort, for necess aries for Captain-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line009.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "Roggs Company; so soon as they arrive,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line010.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "you are to see that he receives such",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line011.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "things as he has orders for, and dispatoh",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line012.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "him immediately. If no other Horses, belong",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line013.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "ing to the Country, can be had here, one-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line014.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "of the Country Teams must be stopped,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line015.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 16,
      "text": "and the horses given to him. You must",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line016.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 17,
      "text": "engage the herdsmen to remain with.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line017.png"
    },
    {
