      "text": "the Catlle, until they hear from the Com-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line018.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 19,
      "text": "missary or from me. You must engage ,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/274/274_line019.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 20,
      "text": "all the Coopers you can to make Barrels",
